      "content": "Thanks. I was looking through the geotechnical section on page 42 of the report though—the part about the seismic stability and the soil composition near the shoreline. It mentions some concerns about soil liquefaction during tremors. \n\nHow would you weigh that specific risk against the development plans? Is that something we need to worry about for a high-density complex?",
